<section aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <h2 id="about-heading" class="sr-only">Sobre mí</h2>
  <div class="flex flex-col lg:grid items-center gap-6 lg:grid-cols-5 lg:justify-items-center">
    <div class="lg:col-span-3 prose prose-neutral">
      <p>
        I am a dedicated professional with experience in urban design and landscape architecture. I started my career at Jordi Henrich's studio, where I worked in urban and landscape projects, from the masterplan scale to the executive and detail project. Currently, I work as Junior Architect and Landscape Designer at LandLab, learning day by day while working in urban design projects, resilient coastal infrastructures and research projects related to landscape and ecology.
      </p>
      <p>
        I developed my academic journey mostly at the Barcelona School of Architecture (ETSAB-UPC), where I graduated in 2023 with a Bachelor's Degree in Architecture. Within my years of study, I had the opoortunity to study one year at Roma Tre University. Working in a different environment, a differnt language and with new people enhanced my communication skills and further deepened my understanding of teamwork. Later in 2024, I graduated with honors from the Master's Degree in Architecture, with a thesis about the regenerative agricultural landscape in the Metropolitan Region of Barcelona.
      </p>
      <p>
        I am a highly motivated professional fluent in English and Italian. I am concerned about how the climate change will affect our landscapes and urban environments and I am always willing to create new and innovative solutions, using resilient and adaptative architecture.
      </p>
